   (p p) projection: -8*(Q2*t1*u1 + m**2*t1**2 + 2*m**2*t1*u1 + m**2*u1**2 + t1**2*u1 + t1*u1**2)/(t1*u1)
2. Fhat_2^g/(z e^2) and Fhat_L^g/(z e^2) obtained (phase-space integral done analytically in cos theta)
3. |H2 - standard form| = 1.57772181044202361082345713057e-30 ;  |HL - standard form| = 3.94430452610505902705864282641e-31
   H2 = 2{[z^2+(1-z)^2+4e z(1-3z)-8e^2z^2] ln((1+b)/(1-b)) + b[8z(1-z)-1-4e z(1-z)]},  e = m^2/Q^2
   HL = 2{-8 e z^2 ln((1+b)/(1-b)) + 4 b z(1-z)},  b = sqrt(1 - 4 e z/(1-z)), threshold z < 1/(1+4e)
4. lim_{m->0} [H2 - 2 P_qg/T_F ln(Q^2/m^2)] = 4*z**2*log(1 - z) - 16*z**2 - 4*z*log(1 - z) + 16*z + (-4*z**2 + 4*z - 2)*log(z) + 2*log(1 - z) - 2
   equals 2 C_2^g/T_F (MSbar, massless): True
   lim_{m->0} HL = -8*z*(z - 1)  (= 2 C_L^g/T_F = 8 z(1-z))
5. Tr[...] (D dims, physical pol sum) = 8*p_plus*(epsilon*kT2 + epsilon*m**2 - 2*kT2*xi**2 + 2*kT2*xi - kT2 - m**2)/(xi - 1)
   f_{Q/g}^bare/(as/2pi T_F): pole = 2*xi**2 - 2*xi + 1 ;  finite = log(m**(-4*xi**2 + 4*xi - 2)*mu**(4*xi**2 - 4*xi + 2))
   pole = P_qg/T_F : True
   MSbar finite part = P_qg/T_F ln(mu^2/m^2) : True
   m=0 kernel check: TR(m=0)*(1-xi)/(...) -> 8*kT2*p_plus*(epsilon - 2*xi**2 + 2*xi - 1)/(xi - 1)
